{
  "technologies": {
    "framework": "Next.js 14",
    "router": "App Router",
    "language": "TypeScript",
    "styling": [
      "TailwindCSS",
      "shadcn/ui"
    ]
  },
  "guidelines": {
    "design": {
      "principles": [
        "Modern and beautiful UI",
        "Clean and consistent design language",
        "Responsive layouts which works on both mobile and desktop",
        "Smooth transitions and animations"
      ]
    },
    "code": {
      "style": [
        "Follow Next.js 14 best practices",
        "Implement proper error handling",
        "Write clean, maintainable code"
      ]
    },
    "productTour": [
      "The outreach product also runs as a no-login demo at /product-tour (docs/outreach/PRODUCT-TOUR.md). It uses the same pages and components; only the data provider changes.",
      "A feature change includes its contract entry (npm run demo:contract), its demo handler (lib/outreach/backend/demo/rpc|fn/<area>.ts), seed data, and, if it adds a screen, its route manifest entry (lib/outreach/backend/demo/routes.ts).",
      "In app/outreach, components/outreach and lib/outreach: data only through db / rpc / callFn, links and routing through @/lib/outreach/nav, browser storage through kv from @/lib/outreach/storage. Never import @/utils/supabase/client, @/lib/api, next/link or next/navigation there.",
      "Demo code (lib/outreach/backend/demo) never touches the network, uses relative imports only and the store's seeded random.",
      "A PR that changes app/outreach or lib/outreach runs npm run demo:check (part of npm run lint) and npm run demo:check:e2e against a running app."
    ]
  }
}
